('bmlt-mycovirology1-mock-001','BMLT','BMLT NHPC Licensing','mock','free',1,'{"question":"A skin scraping is examined in 10% KOH. The purpose of KOH is to?","translation":"","options":["Clear keratin and cellular debris","Stain bacterial capsules","Detect viral antigen","Measure fungal toxin"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"KOH dissolves keratin and improves visualization of fungal elements. नेपाली: KOH ले keratin हटाएर fungus देख्न सजिलो बनाउँछ।","explanationNe":"KOH ले keratin हटाएर fungus देख्न सजिलो बनाउँछ।","topic":"Clinical Mycology & Virology"}'::jsonb,true),
